Package: rallyr
Title: Parse and Analyse SwingVision Tennis Session Exports
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Package", "Maintainer", , "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parse tennis practice-session exports from the SwingVision app
    (either its public share API or a raw copy-pasted match page) into a
    tidy, one-row-per-match table, persist them to a local DuckDB database,
    and compute derived per-rally and per-session metrics. Sessions can be
    kept as a portable "bundle" file of the raw payloads, which the package's
    browser app reads, merges and writes without sending any data anywhere.
    Ships with a synthetic sample dataset so the bundled example workflow can
    be run without any real session data. This package is MIT-licensed and is
    not affiliated with, nor endorsed by, SwingVision, in any way.
